# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# The shared identifier vectors are compared byte for byte across faces, so a CRLF checkout of
# them is drift. `eol=lf` on a path overrides core.autocrlf for it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Named explicitly, so content detection can never decide them.
crates/ikigai-events/tests/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
crates/ikigai-events-cloudevents/tests/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
